        },
        {
            "+content": "While trying to get a good seat for the fireworks show, Jin is suddenly caught up in his sister's hero summoning and whisked away to another world. As compensation for the mix-up, the gods grant him overpowered skills, a house, and helpful items. But Jin has no intention of making a name for himself like his sister. No, his goal is to keep his distance from her heroic business and settle into a life of peace and comfort away from it all. But in a world overrun with gods and monsters, even a quiet life can turn into an adventure. <em class=de-emphasized>(from manga light novel)</em>",
